    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Marwan Kaabour: London-based graphic designer, artist and writer (Beirut-born, moved to London 2011). Senior / independent principal: MA Graphic Design at LCC, ~7 years at Barnbrook rising to Senior Designer, then his own practice since 2020; cultural clients V&A, Art Basel, Serpentine, Somerset House, Christies, Banksy, Fenty. Founder of Takweer (queer Arab archive) and author of The Queer Arab Glossary (Saqi, 2024). Work Status Freelance: his own info page states independent practice founded 2020 (authoritative). Caps locked Graphic design; his book/editorial + archive work also reads as Identity systems / Copywriting (see Open Q). Verified IG @ustaz_marwan is him (bio + posts match).",
